        <activityName xml:lang="en">Stone groundwood pulp, SGW, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Stone groundwood pulp, SGW, at plant
na;
UUID: 2d1c15a8-057a-3040-b5c2-e483e22120f3
This module includes the production of bleached stone ground wood pulp (SGW) - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, mechanical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a Swiss and a German LCA study used as European average data
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern average technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European market mechanical pulp production in 2000: 901 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2d1c15a8-057a-3040-b5c2-e483e22120f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
